  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "fbcdfdee-956f-4ef7-b581-6cd672a14570",
    "name": "Google Play Developer Orders Reviews API",
    "description": "The Google Play Developer API allows you to perform a number of publishing and app-management tasks. It includes the Subscriptions and In-App Purchases API, which lets you manage in-app purchases and subscriptions, and the Reviews API for retrieving and replying to user reviews. This specification covers the purchases, reviews, and subscriptions resources of the Google Play Developer API v3.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Google Play Developer Support",
